        "title": "Signing keys of the release pipeline are not rotated",
        "description": "The keys that sign the artefacts of the release pipeline have not been replaced since they were created. A leaked key would let an attacker sign artefacts that look genuine.",
        "rating": "medium",
        "treatment": "mitigate",
        "treatment-notes": "Rotate the keys every year and record each rotation.",
